content.text:
Data dirs are empty and the only input (`pdtb2.csv`) is LDC-gated — per the protocol, no runnable data means no Docker run.

```json
{
  "paper_url": "https://aclanthology.org/C18-1048/",
  "entrypoint": {"command": "bash ./prepare_data.sh && python main.py train 1", "source": "README Usage 段"},
  "env_analysis": {
    "python_version_required": "3.6.4",
    "framework_required": "pytorch 0.3.1, allennlp 0.4.1, gensim 3.1.0, nltk 3.2.5, scikit-learn 0.19.1, tensorboardX 1.0",
    "evidence": "README Requirements 段"
  },
  "external_apis": [],
  "data": {
    "datasets_needed": ["PDTB 2.0 (pdtb2.csv from cgpotts/pdtb2)", "GoogleNews-vectors-negative300.bin.gz", "ELMo 2x4096_512_2048cnn_2xhighway options/weights", "pre-trained weights (Google Drive, for eval)"],
    "toy_data_in_repo": false,
    "status": [
      {"dataset": "PDTB 2.0 / pdtb2.csv", "state": "licensed", "source": "https://github.com/cgpotts/pdtb2 — 'This link is password protected. I will give out the password to people who have the requisite LDC license.' (LDC2008T05, paid/DUA)", "version_uncertain": false},
      {"dataset": "GoogleNews word2vec", "state": "public_auto", "source": "public mirror, ~1.6GB", "version_uncertain": false},
      {"dataset": "ELMo original 5.5B/large weights", "state": "public_auto", "source": "allennlp s3 public files", "version_uncertain": false},
      {"dataset": "pre-trained model weights", "state": "public_manual", "source": "Google Drive link in README (requires browser confirm)", "version_uncertain": false}
    ],
    "used_for_smoke": "none"
  },
  "docker": {
    "images_tried": [],
    "image_used": null,
    "pull_success": null,
    "run_command": null
  },
  "install": {"status": "skipped", "log_tail": "skipped: no runnable data"},
  "run": {"command": null, "status": "skipped: no runnable data", "output_tail": ""},
  "smoke_verdict": "blocked_data_licensed",
  "all_blockers": [
    {"verdict": "blocked_data_licensed", "confirmed_by": "static", "detail": "data/raw, data/interim/*, data/processed/* are all empty. prepare_data.sh 和 data/preprocess.py 的唯一输入是 ./data/raw/pdtb2.csv,该文件来自 cgpotts/pdtb2,明确要求持有 LDC PDTB 2.0 (LDC2008T05) 许可才能获得解压密码。仓库不含任何 toy/sample 数据,主流程无法在无数据情况下启动。"},
    {"verdict": "blocked_data_manual", "confirmed_by": "static", "detail": "eval 路径额外需要 README 中 Google Drive 上的 weights/ 目录(需浏览器点击确认下载),以及 config.py 中硬编码的本地路径 ~/Projects/GoogleNews-vectors-negative300.bin.gz 与 ~/Projects/ELMo/*.json|hdf5;后两者公开可下(约1.6GB+350MB),但路径需在 config.py 中修改(属改代码范围)。"}
  ],
  "blocker_attribution": "genuine",
  "verdict_reason": "唯一数据源 PDTB 2.0 需 LDC 付费许可、仓库无 toy 数据,连数据预处理这一步都无法启动,故未起容器。"
}
```

补充说明(不计入结论):环境层看起来也很吃力——pytorch 0.3.1 + allennlp 0.4.1 需要 Python 3.6 镜像(`python:3.6` 仍可拉取),但未实际验证;且 `config.py` 里嵌入/ELMo 路径为作者本机绝对路径,不改代码就无法指向下载好的文件,即便拿到 PDTB 也会在这一点上判 `blocked_code`。

